sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Client
  participant Identity as Identity/Tenant API
  participant Queue as Durable Job Queue
  participant Worker as Isolated Worker
  participant Secret as Secret Broker/KMS
  participant Repo as Repository Broker
  participant Engine as Rust Engine
  participant Provider as Provider Registry
  participant Model as Model API
  participant Audit as Audit/Evidence Store

  User->>Client: Submit task + workspace reference
  Client->>Identity: authenticated request(tenant, workspace, policy)
  Identity->>Identity: authorize, quota, idempotency key
  Identity->>Queue: enqueue tenant-scoped job
  Queue-->>Client: job id + event cursor
  Queue->>Worker: lease job with bounded budget
  Worker->>Secret: resolve tenant/provider credential handle
  Worker->>Repo: materialize repository into isolated workspace
  Worker->>Engine: run(task, policy, workspace, secret handle)
  Engine->>Provider: normalized request
  Provider->>Model: provider-specific HTTPS request
  Model-->>Provider: response / rate-limit metadata
  Provider-->>Engine: proposal or classified error
  Engine->>Audit: redacted events, diff, verification evidence
  Worker-->>Queue: terminal status + artifact references
  Queue-->>Client: replayable events + result metadata
  Client-->>User: review, approve, reject, or retry
